## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to craft and reason about 3-valued constraint systems and backtracking.

## Key Concepts
- 3-valued logic Kleene semantics
- Constraint propagation and backtracking
- Horn-like implication patterns

## Code Example
```javascript
function kleeneImply(a,b) {
  const notA = a==='T'?'F':a==='F'?'T':'U';
  // simplified Kleene-like rule: true if notA is F or b is T; unknown if either is U
  if (notA==='F' || b==='T') return 'T';
  if (notA==='U' || b==='U') return 'U';
  return 'F';
}
```

